{"5291360":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Solo Cards","steam_appid":5291360,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE DECK. NINE WAYS TO PLAY SOLO.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Cards is a collection of nine solo card games built around one simple idea: a single classic 54-card deck, put to use in games that are anything but ordinary.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frozen survival to underground combat, from pastry salons to futuristic cities, each game offers its own rules, atmosphere and decisions to master.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NINE GAMES, NINE WORLDS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skarnfrost: Cross a frozen shipwreck compartment by compartment. Manage your health, weapons and potions while hostile creatures close in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skyline: Build four towers in the right order, using suits and ascending values while keeping pollution and population under control.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Double Agent: Infiltrate a hostile network. Capture, cover or extract your targets, and neutralize every Figure before the operation collapses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Trefoil Battle: Enter an underground 3×3 ring. Play your Clubs to trigger powerful techniques and knock out the enemy deck before<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  your own runs dry.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alchemy 11: Dissolve numbered reagents by forming pairs that total 11, or unite the Jack, Queen and King to complete the Great Work.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clockwork Aces: Purge the workshop piles and uncover the four Aces before the clockwork barrel runs out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Deck Striker: Lead a tactical football match through six defensive lines and two halves. Choose your plays carefully and score more goals than your opponent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pastry Stars: Serve twelve prestigious hosts, compose the perfect pastry orders and protect your reputation in an elegant salon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hazel Run: Forage through the autumn woods, push your luck for bigger hauls, and stash your hazelnuts before a predator catches you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COMPLETE SOLO CARD-GAME COLLECTION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 9 distinct games with their own mechanics, themes and difficulty<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Every game played with a familiar classic 54-card deck<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short, replayable sessions built around tactical decisions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interactive tutorials and clear in-game rules<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Statistics, challenges, progression and unlockable rewards<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- French, English, Spanish and Portuguese interface<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDITS &amp; INSPIRATIONS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Cards is developed by an independent solo developer and card-game enthusiast.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games are original creations inspired by classic solo card games and modern takes on the genre, including:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skarnfrost: inspired by Scoundrel, by Zach Gage and Kurt Bieg<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alchemy 11: inspired by Elevens \/ Make 11, a traditional patience game<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Double Agent: inspired by Card Capture, by Lucas Gentry<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skyline: inspired by Cardbury, by Iffix Y Santaph<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Trefoil Battle: inspired by Club Fight, by D. Teuber<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clockwork Aces: inspired by Aces Up \/ Idiot's Delight, a traditional patience game<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pastry Stars: inspired by Merchant's Solitaire, by Gregg Jewell<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Striker and Hazel Run are original, unpublished creations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music credits include &quot;The Last Horizon&quot; by djovan and &quot;Boxing Wrestling MMA Music&quot; by mirostar.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE DECK. NINE WAYS TO PLAY SOLO.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Cards is a collection of nine solo card games built around one simple idea: a single classic 54-card deck, put to use in games that are anything but ordinary.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frozen survival to underground combat, from pastry salons to futuristic cities, each game offers its own rules, atmosphere and decisions to master.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NINE GAMES, NINE WORLDS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skarnfrost: Cross a frozen shipwreck compartment by compartment. Manage your health, weapons and potions while hostile creatures close in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skyline: Build four towers in the right order, using suits and ascending values while keeping pollution and population under control.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Double Agent: Infiltrate a hostile network. Capture, cover or extract your targets, and neutralize every Figure before the operation collapses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Trefoil Battle: Enter an underground 3×3 ring. Play your Clubs to trigger powerful techniques and knock out the enemy deck before<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  your own runs dry.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alchemy 11: Dissolve numbered reagents by forming pairs that total 11, or unite the Jack, Queen and King to complete the Great Work.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clockwork Aces: Purge the workshop piles and uncover the four Aces before the clockwork barrel runs out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Deck Striker: Lead a tactical football match through six defensive lines and two halves. Choose your plays carefully and score more goals than your opponent.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pastry Stars: Serve twelve prestigious hosts, compose the perfect pastry orders and protect your reputation in an elegant salon.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hazel Run: Forage through the autumn woods, push your luck for bigger hauls, and stash your hazelnuts before a predator catches you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COMPLETE SOLO CARD-GAME COLLECTION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 9 distinct games with their own mechanics, themes and difficulty<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Every game played with a familiar classic 54-card deck<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short, replayable sessions built around tactical decisions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interactive tutorials and clear in-game rules<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Statistics, challenges, progression and unlockable rewards<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- French, English, Spanish and Portuguese interface<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREDITS &amp; INSPIRATIONS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Cards is developed by an independent solo developer and card-game enthusiast.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The games are original creations inspired by classic solo card games and modern takes on the genre, including:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skarnfrost: inspired by Scoundrel, by Zach Gage and Kurt Bieg<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Alchemy 11: inspired by Elevens \/ Make 11, a traditional patience game<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Double Agent: inspired by Card Capture, by Lucas Gentry<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Skyline: inspired by Cardbury, by Iffix Y Santaph<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Trefoil Battle: inspired by Club Fight, by D. Teuber<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clockwork Aces: inspired by Aces Up \/ Idiot's Delight, a traditional patience game<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pastry Stars: inspired by Merchant's Solitaire, by Gregg Jewell<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Striker and Hazel Run are original, unpublished creations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music credits include &quot;The Last Horizon&quot; by djovan and &quot;Boxing Wrestling MMA Music&quot; by mirostar.<\/p>","short_description":"Nine independent solo card games, all played with a single classic 54-card deck. Survive a frozen wreck, build a skyline, infiltrate a spy network, step into an underground ring or run a chic pastry salon: each game brings its own rules and tactical tension.","supported_languages":"English, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5291360\/0d6cf55d3f34b1428752473188211c4fcf7a7cd2\/header.jpg?t=1793735420","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5291360\/e84aca81e5ae03fd65a8140ce757d9ffff2f2cfd\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793735420","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5291360\/e84aca81e5ae03fd65a8140ce757d9ffff2f2cfd\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793735420","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated graphics with DirectX 11 support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 2.5 GHz or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated or dedicated graphics with DirectX 11 support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/stro